{"unit_id":"luomeii__dsh-review-squad#card-zh","repo":"luomeii/dsh-review-squad","commit":"0dbae773dfcd6aa106b410d4ab19306e97219859","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-review-squad 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的并行代码评审插件，提供 /review 命令和 code_review 工具。它调用 spawn 子代理，默认由安全、正确性、测试和风格四类评审员分别检查指定改动，并按严重度合并结果。用户可以选择评审范围、评审角色和关注点，也可为评审员配置独立模型；命令支持后台运行，Web 设置页可调整路由、语言和超时。适合希望在提交改动前获得多角度审阅的 DSH 用户。需要配置 DSH 的 spawn 子代理提供方。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:236-261","engine.js:60-123","lib/client.js:1-15"]}
{"unit_id":"luomeii__dsh-review-squad#card-en","repo":"luomeii/dsh-review-squad","commit":"0dbae773dfcd6aa106b410d4ab19306e97219859","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-review-squad reviews DSH changes through a command or tool. It dispatches security, correctness, tests, and style subagents, then groups findings by severity. Users select scope and reviewers, run reviews in the background, and configure reviewer models in Web settings. Requires DSH spawn.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:236-261","engine.js:60-123","lib/client.js:1-15"]}
